<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="Dth1WW_variable MAmtDW_variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/red_hat_display_latin_wght_normal-s.p.0i19_zvmn6g2i.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/red_hat_text_latin_wght_normal-s.p.1lr4iqcgqh16o.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/landing/logo-wordmark-blue-transparent.svg 1x, /landing/logo-wordmark-blue-transparent.svg 2x"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/1450peuthb8ib.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/1kexj4s7oxhs2.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1_34b_7v2bo4_.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3_65-ylqd3ihq.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2nii411saqstq.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2ad4gb6on5vl1.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2c3mg3r-05n1w.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0umf92h1sb77c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2xejmvvwioq8y.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3w2z-ztk2e6n4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3eshax9d5v8th.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0ygfzpyu8gn_-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0er9dc_qscrpf.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/19v33ac8f1cd6.js" async=""></script><title>RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination detection benchmark | Blue Guardrails</title><meta name="description" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination benchmark with 10x more annotations through automated detection and human review. Download the free dataset for AI application testing."/><meta name="author" content="Miriam Kümmel"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://blueguardrails.com/en/blog/ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://blueguardrails.com/en/blog/ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://blueguardrails.com/en/blog/ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark"/><meta property="og:title" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination detection benchmark"/><meta property="og:description" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination benchmark with 10x more annotations through automated detection and human review. Download the free dataset for AI application testing."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://blueguardrails.com/en/blog/ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Blue Guardrails"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://blueguardrails.com/api/og?type=blog&amp;slug=ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark&amp;locale=en"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination detection benchmark"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta property="article:published_time" content="2025-11-20"/><meta property="article:author" content="Miriam Kümmel"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination detection benchmark"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="RAGTruth++: Enhanced hallucination benchmark with 10x more annotations through automated detection and human review. Download the free dataset for AI application testing."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://blueguardrails.com/api/og?type=blog&amp;slug=ragtruth-plus-plus-enhanced-hallucination-detection-benchmark&amp;locale=en"/><link rel=