k" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-white" href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</label></div></div></form></div></section><div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 mt-12"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 "><div class="flex-shrink-0"><img alt="Miriam Kümmel" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_images/7f34e1a749ef9971c3b9-320.webp 1x, /_images/7f34e1a749ef9971c3b9-320.webp 2x" src="/_images/7f34e1a749ef9971c3b9-320.webp"/></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Miriam Kümmel</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Co-Founder at Blue Guardrails</div></div></div></div></article><aside class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-12"><h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg-body">Related articles</h2><ul class="space-y-3"><li><a class="text-brand underline underline-offset-4" href="/en/blog/why-hallucination-benchmarks-miss-the-mark">Why hallucination benchmarks miss the mark</a></li><li><a class="text-brand underline underline-offset-4" href="/en/blog/graph-rag-vs-agentic-rag">Graph, vector, or both? What works best for agentic RAG</a></li><li><a class="text-brand underline underline-offset-4" href="/en/blog/high-throughput-vlm-ocr">Open source OCR with Vision Language Models: High throughput and low cost</a></li></ul><a class="mt-6 inline-block font-semibold text-brand underline underline-offset-4" href="/en/blog">All articles</a></aside><footer class="bg-brand py-12 text-white md:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1350px] px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12 sm:gap-12 sm:mb-16"><div class="lg:pr-24"><h2 class="mb-6 text-[2.125rem] font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-[3.5rem] lg:text-[4.5rem]">Create reliable AI agents</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center"><p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">Monitor, evaluate, steer, and continuously optimize your AI agents with one reliability layer built for production.</p><div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md cursor-pointer font-medium duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 px-8 text-lg bg-white text-brand transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] hover:bg-[#E9EFF9]">Contact Us</button></div></div></div><div class="pt-8"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-3 text-sm sm:gap-6"><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en">Home</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/about">About</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/resources">Resources</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/blog">Blog</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/videos">Videos</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/contact">Contact</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en#faq">FAQ</a><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><button type="button" class="cursor-pointer text-white/85 transition-colors hover:text-white">Cookie settings</button><a class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/en/imprint">Imprint</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/blue-guardrails" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white/85 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="LinkedIn"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" strok